    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rest? it doesn't feel like rest though. it feels more like... nothingness. like the pilot light just went out and there's nothing left to keep the house warm. if everything is just noise, then what's the benefit of staying in the room? it feels more logical to just stop fighting the silence.",
